                              "rawSource":  "\u0026IsAuthorized = Not (GAMSession.IsAnonymousUser(\u0026GAMErrors))\nIF Not \u0026IsAuthorized AND \u0026AllowAutoRegisteredUser\n\t\u0026GAMUser = GeneXusSecurity.GAMUser.Get()\n\t\u0026IsAuthorized = \u0026GAMUser.IsAutoRegisteredUser\nEndIf\n",
